@startuml guardrail-state
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam defaultFontColor #1e293b
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #f1f5f9
    BorderColor #3b82f6
    FontColor #1e293b
    ArrowColor #3b82f6
    StartColor #16a34a
    EndColor #dc2626
}
skinparam noteBorderColor #f59e0b
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #fffbeb
skinparam noteFontColor #92400e

title Guardrail 状态机：Action 风险分级处理

[*] --> Pending : Agent 生成 Action

state Pending #e2e8f0
state Checking #dbeafe : 风险评估中

Pending --> Checking : 提交检查

state "已批准执行" as Approved #dcfce7
state "沙盒执行" as Sandboxed #dcfce7
state "等待人工确认" as HITL #fef9c3
state "已拦截" as Blocked #fee2e2

Checking --> Approved : 读操作\n无副作用
Checking --> Sandboxed : 写操作\n有限范围
Checking --> HITL : 破坏性操作\n删除/部署/外发
Checking --> Blocked : 违反约束\n越权行为

Approved --> [*] : 返回结果
Sandboxed --> [*] : 隔离执行，返回结果
HITL --> Approved : 人工批准
HITL --> Blocked : 人工拒绝
Blocked --> Pending : 附带修复建议\n重新生成 Action

note right of HITL
  Human-in-the-Loop 触发条件
  • git push / git reset --hard
  • rm -rf / 批量删除
  • curl 外部网络请求
  • 生产环境部署命令
end note

note right of Blocked
  拦截后必须提供
  • 明确的拒绝原因
  • 合规的替代方案建议
  • 相关规则引用（AGENTS.md）
end note

@enduml
